WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.070
- Drew, hey. Jesse Palmer,
host of "The Bachelor."

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:05.903
How are you?

00:00:05.903 --> 00:00:07.800
I know I'm just showing
up at a weird moment here,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:11.173
but listen, I think there's
something you don't know.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:14.053
Are you okay if I just
steal you for a second?

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.440
Come on, we gotta do this.

